  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nClear-wave income gains 4
    gold per talent per active Lucky Leaves bond LEVEL. This uses the current bond
    level; repeated combat activations do not accumulate more income.\r\n\nSUPPORT
    WHILE OWNED\nTeam / Bullet pierce: +1\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3
    traits \xD71/2/4; merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN
    THE WAITING REALM\nA tunneller who bound scattered maps into a public atlas.
    Officials sealed dangerous routes by sealing their residents inside, so they
    stole the atlas back. They mark blocked exits in ink readable from either side.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, gain 0 gold directly. This is not kill loot and
    does not count as collecting a coin.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: clock,
    clover. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star
    bodies merge unless the talent forbids it."
